  "",
  "## Run files",
  "",
  "The run directory is the one `orchestration` defines in its context-lifecycle",
  "reference: `.orca/<date>-<slug>/` in the root worktree. Delivery keeps its state",
  "under `orchestrate/` there, never in a task worktree:",
  "",
  "| File                     | Holds                                                                                                                                                                                                          | Written                                     |",
